---
 CHANGELOG.md                            |   1 +
 antigravity_mission_control/jobs.py     |  22 ++--
 antigravity_mission_control/jobstore.py |  21 ++-
 tests/test_malformed_status.py          | 164 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 194 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)
